{# Word version of the CV, for applicant-tracking systems that ask for .docx
   outright rather than a PDF. Single-column and plain, since its only job is to
   survive a parser. Rendered to markdown from the same `industry` data as the
   PDF, then converted by pandoc.

   Markdown output keeps Jinja's default delimiters, unlike the angle-bracket
   ones the .tex templates use. Values pass through unconverted (render.make_env
   gives `.md` a pass-through finalizer), so the inline markdown in the YAML —
   links, bold, emphasis — survives into the DOCX as real formatting. #}
# Dr. Jan Hermann

{{ industry.tagline }}

{% set ncites = custom_data.scholar_citations.value.values()|sum %}
{% set nstars = software|selectattr("stars", "defined")|map(attribute="stars")|sum %}
{{ nstars // 50 * 50 }}+ GitHub stars · shipped in {{ industry.production_codes|length }} production codes · {{ references|length }} publications · {{ "{:,}".format(ncites // 100 * 100) }}+ citations

Berlin, Germany
{% for key in industry.contact_keys %}
· [{{ contact[key][0] }}]({{ contact[key][1] }}{{ contact[key][0] }})
{%- endfor %}
· [Google Scholar]({{ contact["Google Scholar"][1] }}{{ contact["Google Scholar"][0] }})

{{ industry.summary }}

## Experience

{% for job in industry.experience %}
### {{ job.role }} — {{ job.company }}{% if job.location %}, {{ job.location }}{% endif %}

{{ job.date|dateformat }}

{% for b in job.bullets %}
- {{ b }}
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}
## Education

{% for deg in industry.education %}
- **{{ deg.title }}** — {{ deg.detail }}
{% endfor %}

## Skills

{% for s in industry.skills %}
- **{{ s.area }}** — {{ s["items"] }}
{% endfor %}

## Open source

{% for entry in industry.software %}
{% set item = software|selectattr("name", "equalto", entry.name)|first %}
- **{{ item.name }}** — {{ entry.blurb }} · {{ item.role }}{% if item.stars %} · {{ item.stars }} stars{% endif %} · <{{ item.url }}>
{% endfor %}

Shipped inside {{ industry.production_codes|join(", ") }}.

## Awards

{% for item in industry.awards %}
- **{{ item.year }}** — {{ item.text }}
{% endfor %}

## Mentoring and service

{% for item in industry.service %}
- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}

## Publications

Citation counts from Google Scholar. Complete list including book chapters and
theses: <https://hrmnn.net/cv.pdf>

{% for item in references|selectattr("type", "in", ["article-journal", "article"])|sortrefs %}
{% set title, authors, ref = item|reftomd %}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ title }} · {{ authors }} · {{ ref }}{% if item.cited_by %} · {{ item.cited_by }} citations{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

## Keywords

{{ industry.portal_keywords }}
